@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - IoT设备数据接入流程图

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E4D7B
  ActorBorderColor #2E4D7B
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E4D7B
}

participant "华为云IoT平台" as iot
participant "AmqpClient\n(ApplicationRunner)" as amqp
participant "线程池\nExecutorService" as pool
participant "IDeviceDataService" as dataSvc
participant "DeviceDataMapper" as mapper
participant "MySQL\n设备数据表" as db

== 1. 应用启动: 建立AMQP连接 ==
amqp -> amqp : @PostConstruct\nrun(ApplicationArguments)
amqp -> amqp : start()
amqp -> iot : 创建AMQP 1.0连接\n(accessKey + accessCode)
note right
  连接参数:
  host/port/vhost
  SSL信任所有证书
  客户端ID = 本机IP
end note
iot --> amqp : Connection建立成功
amqp -> iot : 创建Session
amqp -> iot : 创建MessageConsumer
amqp -> iot : 注册MessageListener
amqp -> amqp : 连接成功, 等待消息

== 2. 设备数据上报 ==
iot -> amqp : push(Message)
note right
  消息内容:
  topic / messageId
  notify_data body
  services: [{serviceId,
    properties: {key:val}}]
end note
amqp -> pool : submit(processMessage)
pool -> pool : processMessage(message)
pool -> pool : message.getBody(String)
pool -> pool : JSON解析
pool -> pool : 提取notify_data

== 3. 数据转换与存储 ==
pool -> pool : JSONUtil.toBean\nIotMsgNotifyData
pool -> dataSvc : batchInsertDeviceData(notifyData)
dataSvc -> dataSvc : 遍历services
dataSvc -> dataSvc : 遍历properties\n构建DeviceData对象
dataSvc -> mapper : batchInsert(List<DeviceData>)
mapper -> db : INSERT INTO device_data
db --> mapper : 批量写入成功
mapper --> dataSvc : 影响行数
dataSvc --> pool : 完成
pool --> amqp : ACK

== 4. 后续: 告警规则匹配 ==
note over dataSvc
  设备数据入库后
  后台可基于AlertRule
  进行告警规则匹配
end note

@enduml
